  "sections": [
    {
      "sectionId": "section-introduction",
      "heading": "Planescape Background and Feats Introduction",
      "sourceAnchor": "introduction",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-1",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "Planescape: Adventures in the Multiverse",
              "href": "https://www.amazon.com/Planescape-Adventures-Multiverse-Collection-Adventure/dp/0786969040?crid=IEG0A6GP6RED&keywords=adventures+in+the+multiverse&qid=1697479137&sprefix=adventures+in+the+mu%2Caps%2C223&sr=8-1&linkCode=ll1&tag=rpgbot-20&linkId=ab45fc2f5ca352c148e69a603fae3fc2&language=en_US&ref_=as_li_ss_tl"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": " ("
            },
            {
              "type": "link",
              "text": "affiliate link",
              "href": "https://rpgbot.net/about/faq#what-are-affiliate-links-and-why-do-you-use-them"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": ") brings us two new backgrounds and seven new feats, all of which are restricted to the Planescape campaign. As in other recent products, each background grants a feat, and the feats published in the book form feat trees where one feat is a prerequisite for one or more other feats."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "blockId": "block-section-introduction-2",
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "As befits the theme of Planescape, the backgrounds and feats are all closely associated with the multiverse and with individual planes."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
